WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.500
Two equal paths: explore the analysis and inspect the engineering.

00:05.500 --> 00:10.800
Commercial Intelligence: metrics reconciled to the published pipeline snapshot.

00:10.800 --> 00:14.800
Filter equipment sales in October. Every chart and KPI follows the selection.

00:14.800 --> 00:19.800
Explore a 5% additional discount with volume held constant. A scenario, not a forecast.

00:19.800 --> 00:23.800
Inject a duplicate item. The quality contract prevents double counting.

00:23.800 --> 00:27.800
A negative cost inflates unchecked profit. The invalid item is quarantined.

00:27.800 --> 00:33.800
Inspect two immutable snapshots, correction effects, replay and reconciliation checks.

00:33.800 --> 00:40.000
Independent public-data case: compare Brazil’s CO₂ trends with and without land-use change.
